Augment your rockets with highly flammable materials, causing them to burn targets for [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage over 3 turns. Subsequent shots against burning targets refresh the effect of the duration (but do not stack) and inflict [45, 60, 72, 83, 92 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] additional fire damage.

Targets affected by this burning that fall below 25% life enter a state of panic, giving them a [15%, 20%, 23%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)] chance each turn to flee in terror from you.

The fire damage will increase with your Steampower.
